WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.030 --> 00:00:07.800
Raise a purchase request with its lines and estimated prices, and send it for approval.

2
00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:14.480
Purchasing follows every purchase: the request, the approval, the order, the delivery and the bill.

3
00:00:14.480 --> 00:00:20.800
At the top: open orders, late deliveries, items running low and requests waiting.

4
00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:27.350
Anyone can ask to buy something. Choose New purchase request.

5
00:00:27.350 --> 00:00:33.690
Say what it is for.

6
00:00:33.690 --> 00:00:37.320
The department that pays for it.

7
00:00:37.320 --> 00:00:43.490
And why. A clear reason gets a faster yes.

8
00:00:43.490 --> 00:00:51.170
For each line, choose an item from the store, or leave it empty for something new.

9
00:00:51.170 --> 00:00:54.430
The quantity.

10
00:00:54.430 --> 00:00:59.450
And the price you expect. It decides who has to approve.

11
00:00:59.450 --> 00:01:09.160
Send the request. It goes to the right approvers by itself, and you are told when it is decided.
